    "notes": {
        "316fee49-1450-4acd-b226-f9db7e5a4901": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 416,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 256,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe account must come from a LinkedIn app with the **Community Management API** product (scopes r_basicprofile, w_organization_social, rw_organization_admin). `organizationId` in SetVariable is the page the flow posts to: by default LinkedIn's test organization **DevTestCo (2414183)**, which accepts posts from any Development-tier app without a page role. To post as a real page instead, make the connected member an approved ADMINISTRATOR of that page and put its numeric ID into the variable. Both posts are public until the delete steps after AfterAll run; if the flow stops in between, delete them by hand."
        }
    }
